omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yOmNws_tNLkQ7kNvwF9d5Lk&_nc_oc=Ado0m-UcF-96crJeUBgT5NSjoqFQZh-3qAb0gdki5AhmAtUV1CZi2BpFHiZc7FqWIsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3yEBaytktwoK8QlIqymK-BWpyF5JxnfbiWnseOxRQycg&oe=69E644B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6L_HR1-J1fAQ7kNvwHoJPNF&_nc_oc=Adqhw5UNIbaVNrinqS8oK1bZPjC_aXMFWSelx0Kwo88H6eTMtBB5mw8nsidv-IJctnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0pH0UwFbpDDvJgOwtJu46d3YvyFEB972A7VL0gz51Rdg&oe=69E64616"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8oTgDErqbYQ7kNvwGFvXzA&_nc_oc=AdpH0f0HTnVOjfWTL0ew3ls9sjUZgTMlKEjv5X8X1w3Ti6GWxXUwN_2bZexvDA-eVyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1s_4wxVErTEkwl5ADrbehbAhaO2fp_xcqoWR3IIcjgPg&oe=69E622F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://